    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSeeking offers in excess of 395,000.\n\n No 4 Fern Hill Close is one of 6 deceptively large detached dormer bungalows that are situated within a minutes' walk from the pretty village of Killinick.\n\nThe village has the following amenities: coffee shop; The Merry Elf Pub, Karoo Restaurant & farm shop, hairdressers, Centra Shop with adjoining garage and bus links to Wexford Town, Rosslare Strand and Rosslare Harbour. Numerous sandy beaches, golf courses, Rosslare Europort, Wexford Town and Rosslare Strand are within a ten-minute drive.\n\nYour first impression when walking into the home is how spacious it seems. Accommodation comprises living room, kitchen dining area / conservatory, utility room, bedroom and bathroom on downstairs with a further two bedrooms and shower room upstairs; all the bedrooms are double rooms.\n\nThe proximity to a vibrant village, the large downstairs bedroom and the bus links makes No. 4 the ideal retirement or permanent home and an early viewing is recommended"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.21m x 1.17m\nWith oak flooring.\n\nHall - 3.35m x 2.43m\nWith oak flooring.\n\nLiving Room - 5.14m x 3.85m\nSpacious room, dual aspect with oak flooring and inserted stove.\n\nKitchen / Dining Area - 5.57m x 3.10m\nBright and spacious with tiled flooring and splashbacks, waist and eye level storage and access into the conservatory.\n\nConservatory - 3.55m x 3m\nGreat additional room, double doors access the back garden and large patio.\n\nUtility Room - 2.6m a 1.9m\nWith tiled flooring and splashbacks, fitted waist and eye level storage and plumbed for a washing machine.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.8m x 3.07m\nGreat addition to have a downstairs bedroom.\n\nHotpress - \n\n\nBathroom - 3.04m x 2.65m\nFully tiled with bath,electric shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nUPSTAIRS - \n\n\nLanding - 1.91m x 1.4m\nWith Velux window.\n\nBedroom 2 Jack & Jill ensuite - 5.66m x 3.25m\nLarge double room.\n\nJack and Jill Ensuite / Bathroom - 2.17m x 1.68m\nAlso accessed from the landing, fully tiled with Triton T90 Electric Shower, w.c. and w.h.b.\n\nBedroom 3 - 5.53m x 2.7m\nAnother large double room.\n\n"
      },
